# Read-mode combo — diagram plus table for core stage handoffs
#
# Covers explicit multi-surface requests: a Mermaid sequence view plus a
# structured stage table. This catches cases where a model produces a correct
# narrative but loses the requested diagram/table surface during finalization.
ID="read_combo_pipeline_sequence_table"
NAME="read combo — read pipeline sequence diagram and handoff table"
QUESTION="解释 codrax read mode 一次请求从 analyze 到 finalizer 的时序：必须给 Mermaid sequenceDiagram，并再给一张表列出每个 stage 的输入、输出和主要状态载体（例如 AnalysisIR、EvidenceItems、AnswerDocument、Mutable/BusContext）。"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="analyze explorer extractor finalizer AnalysisIR EvidenceItems AnswerDocument Mutable BusContext"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX='(```mermaid|sequenceDiagram)
(阶段|stage|输入|输出|载体|carrier)'
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="Spring Django"
